      "text": "U.S. Army Soldiers with the 25th Infantry Division execute a HIMARS live-fire exercise during Salaknib 26 at Canantong, Laur, Neuva Ecija—demonstrating rapid strike capability and battlefield dominance. 🚀🔥\n\nSalaknib strengthens interoperability and reinforces enduring partnerships, ensuring allied forces remain ready to respond across the Indo-Pacific.\n\n📍 Laur, Philippines\n📸 Staff Sgt. Jameson Harris\n\n#IndoPacific  #USArmy #25thInfantryDivision #HIMARS #Salaknib26 #LiveFire #Readiness",
